// Cyrus Model Studio (Layer 1), pure + service tests with fakes (no DB, no browser, no network, no model):
// 3D math and golden pick -> UV -> texel cases (cuboid creature, extruded item, glTF mesh), the glTF reader on hostile
// input, lossless channel layers + composite maths, the paint engine (tools, symmetry input, deterministic op log,
